---
// Preview: King Kong's agency page, section for section, in the Dead River
// look and with Dead River facts. Hidden from search and the sitemap.
import Growth from '../../layouts/Growth.astro';
import Arrow from '../../components/growth/Arrow.astro';
import ClientTrust from '../../components/growth/ClientTrust.astro';
import Reviews from '../../components/growth/Reviews.astro';
import { work as workItems } from '../../data/growth-work';
import { googleReviews } from '../../data/reviews';

const CTA = '/kk/strategy-session';
const quote = googleReviews.items[0];
---

<Growth
  title="$50,000 in New Revenue or Your Money Back (Preview)"
  description="Preview of the King Kong agency page structure in the Dead River look."
  ogImage="/images/og/demand-flow.jpg"
  robots="noindex,nofollow"
  campaign
  campaignHref={CTA}
  campaignLabel="Claim your free strategy session"
  campaignShort="Book a call"
>
  <div class="kk">
    <section class="kk-hero wrap">
      <p class="eyebrow" data-rise>Agency · Hire us to do it for you</p>
      <h1 data-split>We guarantee $50,000 in new revenue in 45-60 days or your money back. Plus $500 for wasting your time.</h1>
      <p class="kk-sub" data-rise>For accepted service businesses only. Watch the short video, then claim your free 30-minute strategy session below.</p>
      <div class="kk-video" data-rise>
        <video controls playsinline preload="metadata" poster="/images/og/demand-flow.jpg" src="/50k-demand-flow/assets/demand-flow-vsl-1080p.mp4"></video>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section soft kk-letter">
      <div class="wrap">
        <p>Dear business builder,</p>
        <p>What if you could have as many customers, calls, and booked jobs as your crew could handle? Not someday. In the next 45 to 60 days.</p>
        <p>That's what we do. And we put it in writing, because we've got the results to back it up.</p>
        <div class="button-row"><a class="button" href={CTA}>Claim your free 30-minute strategy session <Arrow /></a></div>
        <small class="kk-rating"><span class="rv-stars" aria-hidden="true">★★★★★</span> Rated 5.0 on Google</small>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section wrap kk-block">
      <h2>Burned by a marketing agency before?</h2>
      <p>Yeah, that's tough. We completely understand. Most of them take your money, run a few ads, and send you a report full of clicks. You can't find the revenue in it because there isn't any.</p>
      <p>We're a little bit different. We're going to prove it by putting our own money on the line.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="section wrap kk-block">
      <h2>Throwing spaghetti at the wall, blindfolded.</h2>
      <p>That's how most business owners do marketing. Boost a post. Try Google Ads for a month. Hire a nephew to do the website. Hope the phone rings.</p>
      <p>It's chaos, and it's why new business feels random. One month you're slammed, the next month you're checking the phone to see if it's broken.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="section wrap kk-block">
      <h2>So how are we different from the armchair experts?</h2>
      <p>We're based in El Paso, Texas, and we work with service businesses nationwide. We don't guess who to show your ads to. We use purchase intent data to find the people who looked up your service in the last few days, and we put your offer in front of only them.</p>
      <p>Then we build the page they land on, answer every lead, follow up, and track it all to the booked job. One team runs the whole thing.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="section soft band-dark kk-proof">
      <div class="wrap">
        <p class="eyebrow">Proof</p>
        <h2>Real businesses. Real numbers.</h2>
        <dl class="kk-stats">
          <div><dd>$20K to $100K</dd><dt>a month, Total Auto Repair</dt></div>
          <div><dd>2 to 8 roofs</dd><dt>a month, Gonzalez & Sons Roofing</dt></div>
          <div><dd>$60K to $250K</dd><dt>a year, The Pipe Whisperers</dt></div>
          <div><dd>$1.2M contract</dd><dt>from one lead, Wicked Logistics</dt></div>
        </dl>
      </div>
    </section>

    <ClientTrust />

    <section class="section wrap kk-block">
      <h2>How the hell can we guarantee results?</h2>
      <p>Because we don't start with a blank audience. We start with Demand Intelligence, the data that tells us who is looking for the services you offer right now.</p>
      <p>Then Demand Flow takes over. Target. Create. Capture. Convert. Ads to the right people, a page built to get the call, a text back in minutes, follow-up that doesn't quit, and tracking to the invoice. When every piece is connected, the number stops being a hope.</p>
      <a class="text-link" href="/demand-flow#how">See the whole system <Arrow /></a>
    </section>

    <section class="section soft kk-cases">
      <div class="wrap">
        <div class="section-head">
          <div>
            <p class="eyebrow">Case studies</p>
            <h2>Become our next success story.</h2>
          </div>
          <a class="text-link" href="/work">All case studies <Arrow /></a>
        </div>
        <div class="kk-grid">
          {workItems.map((w) => (
            <a class="kk-tile" href={`/work/${w.slug}`}>
              <span class="number">{w.name}</span>
              <strong>{w.headline}</strong>
              <em>Read it <Arrow /></em>
            </a>
          ))}
        </div>
        <div class="button-row"><a class="button" href={CTA}>Hit the damn button <Arrow /></a></div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section wrap kk-block">
      <h2>Magic pixie dust, crossed fingers, and a dash of hope and pray.</h2>
      <p>That's the other guys' system. Ours is a predictable, repeatable way of selling. Which ad runs. Which page it lands on. How fast the text goes out. When the follow-up fires. What gets tuned every week. None of it is left to luck.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="section wrap kk-gossip">
      <blockquote>
        <p>"{quote.text}"</p>
        <footer>{quote.name}, Google review</footer>
      </blockquote>
    </section>

    <section class="section soft kk-guarantee" id="guarantee">
      <div class="wrap">
        <p class="eyebrow">The guarantee</p>
        <h2>$50,000 in new revenue in 45-60 days or your money back. Plus $500 for wasting your time.</h2>
        <ul class="check-list">
          <li>If we miss the number inside the window set in your agreement, your Demand Flow service fees are refunded and we pay you $500.</li>
          <li>Revenue counts when it comes from new customers through the system we build. We track it in your CRM against closed jobs or invoices.</li>
          <li>Ad spend goes to the ad platforms and isn't refunded.</li>
          <li>Applies to accepted businesses with a signed agreement. Full terms on the <a class="inline-link" href="/legal/guarantee">guarantee terms</a> page.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section wrap kk-block kk-notfor">
      <h2>Hold on there, tiger. Not so fast.</h2>
      <p>This offer isn't for everybody. To qualify:</p>
      <ol>
        <li><strong>You must be able to take on more work.</strong> If we send you 20 more jobs in 60 days, you need the crew to do them.</li>
        <li><strong>You must fund the agreed ad budget and let us run the ads and pages.</strong> You check them for accuracy. We keep creative control.</li>
        <li><strong>You must answer the leads.</strong> Fast. The system catches them, but you still have to pick up the phone.</li>
        <li><strong>You must not be selling anything shady.</strong> Nothing illegal, scammy, dangerous, or multi-level marketing.</li>
      </ol>
      <p>If that's you, book the 30-minute strategy session. We'll look at your market, your numbers, and tell you straight whether you qualify.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="section soft kk-ps">
      <div class="wrap">
        <p class="eyebrow">P.S.</p>
        <p>In case you skipped to the bottom: we find the people already looking for the services you offer, put your offer in front of them, answer every lead, follow up, and get them booked. $50,000 in new revenue in 45 to 60 days for accepted businesses, or your money back plus $500 for wasting your time. We only take on businesses we believe we can hit the number for.</p>
        <div class="button-row"><a class="button" href={CTA}>Hit the damn button already <Arrow /></a></div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <Reviews />

    <section class="section closing wrap">
      <p class="eyebrow">Last call</p>
      <h2>Hit the damn button.</h2>
      <div class="button-row"><a class="button" href={CTA}>Hit the damn button <Arrow /></a></div>
    </section>
  </div>
</Growth>

<style>
  .kk-hero { text-align: center; padding: clamp(56px, 8vw, 110px) 0 32px; }
  .kk-hero h1 { max-width: 20ch; margin: 18px auto 0; font-size: clamp(38px, 6.4vw, 92px); line-height: 0.95; letter-spacing: -0.05em; text-transform: uppercase; text-shadow: 0 30px 80px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.7); }
  .kk-sub { max-width: 640px; margin: 26px auto 0; font-size: clamp(18px, 2vw, 22px); color: #cfccc4; }
  .kk-video { max-width: 960px; margin: 44px auto 0; border-radius: 20px; overflow: hidden; border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.12); box-shadow: 0 40px 120px -30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9), 0 0 120px -20px rgba(227, 160, 112, 0.3); }
  .kk-video video { display: block; width: 100%; aspect-ratio: 16 / 9; background: #000; }

  .kk-letter .wrap { max-width: 720px; }
  .kk-letter p { font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.7; color: #cfccc4; margin: 0 0 18px; }
  .kk-letter p:first-child { font-family: var(--display); font-weight: 800; font-size: 26px; color: var(--ink); }
  .kk-letter .button-row { margin-top: 10px; }
  .kk-rating { display: block; margin-top: 16px; font-size: 13px; color: var(--muted); }
  .kk-rating .rv-stars { color: var(--copper); margin-right: 6px; }

  .kk-block { max-width: 760px; padding-top: 48px; padding-bottom: 48px; }
  .kk-block h2 { font-size: clamp(30px, 4vw, 48px); letter-spacing: -0.04em; text-transform: uppercase; margin-bottom: 18px; }
  .kk-block p { font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.7; color: #cfccc4; margin-bottom: 16px; }
  .kk-block ol { padding-left: 22px; display: grid; gap: 12px; margin: 14px 0 20px; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.6; color: #cfccc4; }
  .kk-block ol strong { color: var(--ink); }

  .kk-stats { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr); gap: 1px; margin: 32px 0 0; border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.12); border-radius: 16px; overflow: hidden; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.12); }
  .kk-stats > div { background: var(--paper); padding: 26px 24px; }
  .kk-stats dd { margin: 0; font-family: var(--display); font-weight: 800; font-size: clamp(28px, 3vw, 40px); letter-spacing: -0.04em; color: var(--ember); }
  .kk-stats dt { margin-top: 8px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--muted); }

  .kk-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 16px; margin-bottom: 36px; }
  .kk-tile { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px; padding: 26px; border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.12); border-radius: 18px; background: linear-gradient(180deg, #161618, #111112); text-decoration: none; color: var(--ink); transition: border-color 0.3s ease, transform 0.3s ease; }
  .kk-tile:hover { border-color: #f2b18555; transform: translateY(-2px); }
  .kk-tile strong { font-family: var(--display); font-size: 22px; letter-spacing: -0.02em; line-height: 1.15; }
  .kk-tile em { font-style: normal; color: var(--copper); font-weight: 600; margin-top: auto; }

  .kk-gossip { max-width: 820px; }
  .kk-gossip blockquote { margin: 0; padding: 36px 40px; border-left: 3px solid var(--copper); background: linear-gradient(180deg, #161618, #111112); border-radius: 0 20px 20px 0; }
  .kk-gossip p { font-family: var(--display); font-size: clamp(22px, 2.6vw, 30px); line-height: 1.3; letter-spacing: -0.02em; margin: 0 0 14px; }
  .kk-gossip footer { font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 12px; letter-spacing: 0.14em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--muted); }

  .kk-guarantee h2 { max-width: 20ch; font-size: clamp(32px, 4.4vw, 58px); text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: -0.04em; margin: 10px 0 30px; }
  .kk-ps .wrap { max-width: 760px; }
  .kk-ps p { font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.7; color: #cfccc4; }

  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .kk-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .kk-stats { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; }
  }
</style>
